#: ../../language/error_codes/E4111.md:1
msgid "E4111"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4111.md:3
msgid "The usage of a `break` statement is invalid."
msgstr "`break` 文の使い方が不正です。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4111.md:5
msgid ""
"This error happens when you use a `break` statement in the "
"initialization, condition, or update statement of a loop."
msgstr "ループの初期化、条件、または更新文で `break` 文を使うと、このエラーが発生します。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4111.md:8
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "誤った例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4111.md:10
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn f(x : Int, y : Int) -> Unit {\n"
"  for i = 0; i < x; i = i + 1 {\n"
"    for j = ({\n"
"            break\n"
"          })\n"
"        j < y\n"
"        j = j + 1 {\n"
"      //            ^^^^^ Error: The usage of break statement is invalid."
"\n"
"      println(i + j)\n"
"    }\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4111.md:14
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "修正方法"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4111.md:16
msgid ""
"Do not write a `break` statement in the initialization, condition, or "
"update statement of a loop. Put it in the loop body instead."
msgstr "ループの初期化、条件、更新文には `break` 文を書かず、ループ本体に置きます。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4111.md:19
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn f(x : Int, y : Int) -> Unit {\n"
"  for i = 0; i < x; i = i + 1 {\n"
"    for j = 0; j < y; j = j + 1 {\n"
"      if i + j > 10 {\n"
"        break\n"
"      }\n"
"      println(i + j)\n"
"    }\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4111.md:23
msgid ""
"The error also occurs when an unlabelled `break` is directly inside a "
"labelled block. Specify the block's label when exiting it:"
msgstr ""
"ラベルのない `break` がラベル付きブロックの直下にある場合にも、このエラーが発生します。"
"ブロックを抜けるときは、そのラベルを指定します："

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4111.md:26
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn value_or_zero(value : Int?) -> Int {\n"
"  result~: {\n"
"    guard value is Some(result) else { break }\n"
"    result\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4111.md:30
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn value_or_zero(value : Int?) -> Int {\n"
"  result~: {\n"
"    guard value is Some(result) else { break result~ 0 }\n"
"    result\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
